1: Policy: Each fisher may keep up to 20 kg per trip; any fish beyond 20 kg must be placed into the community reserve. The reserve is used only in emergencies (up to 5 % of the reserve per event) or for routine maintenance after communal meals; fish removed are returned after use, and the inventory is recorded weekly by the Lake Monitor.
